{"id":"n75797-1-8","stage":0,"title":"조용히 · 安静地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75797-1-8-1","ko":"수업 시간에는 조용히 하렴.","zh":"上课时要安静哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"수업","meaning":"课、上课","explanation":"수업：上课、课堂；与 시간 合用构成“上课时间”。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}},{"text":"시간에는","meaning":"上课时","explanation":"시간：时间；-에 标记时间，-는 标记话题，수업 시간에는 即“上课时”。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간에는","audio":"/audio/27960c6cb7e634237718.mp3"}},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地。","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}},{"text":"하렴.","meaning":"要保持安静哦","explanation":"조용히 하다 是“保持安静”；-렴 是长辈对晚辈亲切的指示或劝告。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하렴","audio":"/audio/79f9f70081bccfb50604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"上课、课堂","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"老师给学生上课、传授知识的活动；这里指上课时间。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"安静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"任何声音都没有地。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"505de0